  "reference": "Rapar Mar Chik 7",
  "copyright": "Biblica® Ochiw Thuolo Motingʼo Loko Manyien™ Weg Loko © 1980, 2002, 2003, 2020 otim gi Biblica, Inc. Biblica® Open New Luo Translation™ Copyright © 1980, 2002, 2003, 2020 by Biblica, Inc. \"Biblica\" en sai mondik mongorore e piny Amerika kendo en kido moyie malongʼo e ofis Biblica, Inc. Itiyo kode gi thuolo moa kuom Biblica, Inc. \"Biblica\" is a trademark registered in the United States Patent and Trademark Office by Biblica, Inc. Used with permission.",
  "verseCount": 26,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "7",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "DEU 7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "7",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Riembo ogendini mamoko",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachu okelou e piny ma udhi donjoe mondo ukaw obed maru, mi oriembonu ogendini mangʼeny kaka jo-Hiti, jo-Girgash, jo-Amor, jo-Kanaan, jo-Perizi, jo-Hivi kod jo-Jebus, ma gin pinje abiriyo madongo kendo maroteke moloyou.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kendo ka Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachu osechiwo gi e lwetu mi uloyogi, to une ni utiekogi duto. Kik ulos winjruok kodgi bende kik utimnegi ngʼwono.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kik ukendru kodgi. Kik uchiw nyiu ni yawuotgi kata kik yawuotu okend nyigi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nimar ginimi yawuotu weya mitine nyiseche mamoko kendo mano dimi mirima mak Jehova Nyasaye mitieku mapiyo nono.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ma e gima onego utimnegi: Mukuru kendegi mag misengini, touru kitegi mopa milamo, tongʼuru sirnigi mag Ashera kendo wangʼuru kido mag-gi milamo e mach.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimar un oganda mowal ne Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachu. Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachu oseyierou kuom ogendini duto manie piny mondo ubed joge, joge owuon mogeno.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jehova Nyasaye ne ok oherou mi oyierou nikech ne ungʼeny moloyo ogendini mamoko, nimar un e oganda matinie moloyo,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to Jehova Nyasaye noyierou nikech noherou kendo orito singruok mane otimo gi kwereu kane ogolou gi tekone maduongʼ kendo warou e piny mane unie wasumbini, e lwet Farao ruodh Misri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngʼeuru ni Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachu en Nyasaye. En Nyasaye ma ja-adiera; marito singruokne mar hera ne tienge gana gi gana mohere kendo rito chikene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "DEU 7:10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "jogo mochaye obiro kumo motiekgi mana ka gineno,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "DEU 7:10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "adier ok obi deko ma ok okumo jogo mochaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "m"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuom mano rituru yorene, buchene kod chikene adimba ma amiyou kawuono.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka uchiko itu ne chikegi kendo uritogi adimba, eka Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachu norit singruokne mar hera kodu kaka ne osingore ne kwereu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obiro herou, gwedhou kendo miyo unyaa mangʼeny, obiro gwedho nyithindo munywolo, cham manie puotheu, decheu, divai manyien, mo, nyiroye ma dhou onywolo kod nyithi jambu e piny mane osingore ne kwereu ni nomigi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibiro gwedhou moloyo ogendini duto; onge ngʼato kuomu madichwo kata madhako ma ok nobed maonge nyathi, kata jambu manobed maonge nyithindo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jehova Nyasaye notiek tuoche duto kuomu; bende ok nokelnu tuoche maricho mane uneno ka un Misri, to tuochego nomak mana wasiku mochayou.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyaka utiek ji duto ma Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachu keto e lwetu. Kik ukechgi bende kik ulam nyisechegi, nimar mano nobednu obadho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Unyalo wacho kendu niya, \"Ogendinigi tek moloyowa. Ere kaka wanyalo riembogi oko?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To kik uluorgi; paruru malongʼo gima ne Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachu otimone Farao gi piny e Misri duto.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne uneno kod wengeu tem malich, honni madongo tekone kod bat morie mane Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachu ogolougo oko. Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachu biro timo mano bende ne oganda makoro uluoro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To bende Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachu biro miyo kihondko omakgi ma kata ngʼato pond e dieru manade to ok notony.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kik gimiu luoro nimar Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachu manie dieru duongʼ kendo en Nyasaye man-gi teko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachu biro riembo ogendinigo kuomu matin tin mana ka uneno. Ok noyienu mondo utiekgi dichiel nimar dipo ka ondiegi onywolore mangʼeny mathagu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachu nochiwgi e lwetu, kowito riekogi nyaka ginirum duto.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obiro chiwo ruodhi mag ogendinigo e lwetu kendo unutiek nyingegi e bwo polo. Onge ngʼama nochungʼ masiru kendo unutiekgi duto.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kido mag nyisechegi nyaka uwangʼ e mach. Kik ugomb fedha kod dhahabu ma gin-go, bende kik ukawgi. Ka utimo kamano, to ginibednu obadho nimar gigo gin gigo makwero ne Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kik ukel gimoro makwero e uteu, nimar un kod gima ukelono nokethi. Kik ubed gi gik machalo kamano nimar enokethgi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
